OL,3,GNEWSAEU deal will 'give back some      
OL,4,Arights' lost to Brexit                 
OL,6,FSome business and political leaders    
OL,7,Fhave predicted how a new deal for a    
OL,8,Fcloser working relationship with the EU
OL,9,Fcould bring "simplified" trade, more   
OL,10,Fstudy opportunities, and a boost to the
OL,11,Fworkforce in the Channel Islands.      
OL,13,FThe agreement between the UK and the   
OL,14,FEU, expected for 2028, would "give back
OL,15,Fsome of the rights" from before Brexit,
OL,16,Fwhile requiring changes to "more than  
OL,17,F100" regulations said Deputy Kirsten   
OL,18,FMorel, Jersey's Assistant Minister for 
OL,19,FEnvironment, Agriculture and Fisheries.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
