OL,3,GNEWSAEU deal will 'give back some      
OL,4,Arights' lost to Brexit                 
OL,6,FEarlier in November, Boris Johnson, who
OL,7,Fnegotiated the original Brexit deal as 
OL,8,Fprime minister, said it was "madness"  
OL,9,Ffor Prime Minister Andy Burnham to make
OL,10,FBrexit his "political priority".       
OL,12,FSir Mark Boleat, Jersey Senator and    
OL,13,FMinister for Planning and Regulation,  
OL,14,Fsaid some people in the Channel Islands
OL,15,Fwith "notions of complete independence"
OL,16,Fhad supported Brexit - but stressed it 
OL,17,Fwas "never the political issue" it was 
OL,18,Fin the UK because they were not in the 
OL,19,FEuropean Union and had no vote.        
